<title>USA: Public Storage Properties XV, XIV to merge.</title>
<headline>Public Storage Properties XV, XIV to merge.</headline>
<dateline>GLENDALE, Calif 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Public Storage Properties XIV Inc said on Wednesday that it agreed to merge with Public Storage Inc.</p>
<p>Each outstanding share of Public Storage Properties XIV's common stock Series A would be converted into either shares of PSA common stock, or $21.73 in cash.</p>
<p>In addition, Public Storage Properties XV Inc and Public Storage Inc said they agreed to merge.</p>
<p>Each share of Public Storage Properties XV common Stock Series A would be converted into Public Storage Inc shares, or $21.99 in cash.</p>
</text>
